THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. Reports produced by it must be checked and approved by the
responsible doctor before they are issued to a patient. The Owner is not liable
